  "name": "Building Blocks - OGC CRDWG Essential Variable Blocks",
  "abstract": "OGC Building Blocks for the Climate Resilience Domain Working Group (CRDWG)\nEssential Variable registry. Provides schema, semantics, and ontology for\ndescribing and publishing Essential Climate Variables as linked data.\n",
